[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0010","text":"啊……看板\n写着『可惜！　此路不通！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0020","text":"又？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0030","text":"这个迷宫，完全走不到终点呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0040","text":"…………\n我可能知道了，终点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0050","text":"真、真的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0060","text":"嗯\n这边"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0080","text":"是、是死路呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0090","text":"……浅仓"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200300_03_0100","text":"呵呵\n根本没搞懂"}]
